  "id": "18187",
  "title": "EDK2 NX protection break some (old) `amd64` guests",
  "description": "# `latest/edge`\n\nAlmaLinux 8 fails to boot (**note**: AlmaLinux 9 is not affected):\n\n```\n!!!! X64 Exception Type - 0E(#PF - Page-Fault)  CPU Apic ID - 00000000 !!!!\nExceptionData - 0000000000000011  I:1 R:0 U:0 W:0 P:1 PK:0 SS:0 SGX:0\nRIP  - 0000000079504400, CS  - 0000000000000038, RFLAGS - 0000000000010206\nRAX  - 00000000799FA154, RCX - 0000000079BDE118, RDX - 000000007B9EC018\nRBX  - 0000000000000000, RSP - 000000007BF39348, RBP - 0000000079BDE118\nRSI  - 000000007A32A6C0, RDI - 0000000079CD3D18\nR8   - 0000000000002000, R9  - 000000007B8ECB18, R10 - 0000000000000000\nR11  - 0000000079941E18, R12 - 0000000079BDE118, R13 - 0000000000000000\nR14  - 00000000799F93B8, R15 - 00000000799F93C0\nDS   - 0000000000000030, ES  - 0000000000000030, FS  - 0000000000000030\nGS   - 0000000000000030, SS  - 0000000000000030\nCR0  - 0000000080010033, CR2 - 0000000079504400, CR3 - 000000007BC01000\nCR4  - 0000000000000668, CR8 - 0000000000000000\nDR0  - 0000000000000000, DR1 - 0000000000000000, DR2 - 0000000000000000\nDR3  - 0000000000000000, DR6 - 00000000FFFF0FF0, DR7 - 0000000000000400\nGDTR - 000000007B9DD000 0000000000000057, LDTR - 0000000000000000\nIDTR - 000000007B19A018 0000000000000FFF,   TR - 0000000000000048\nFXSAVE_STATE - 000000007B9DC460\n!!!! Find image based on IP(0x7996ACA3) (No PDB)  (ImageBase=0000000079945000, EntryPoint=0000000079968000) !!!!\n```\n\nSimilar issue with Fedora 42 (**note**: Fedora 43 is not affected):\n```\n  Booting `Fedora Linux (6.19.13-100.fc42.x86_64) 42 (Container Image)'\n\n!!!! X64 Exception Type - 0E(#PF - Page-Fault)  CPU Apic ID - 00000000 !!!!\nExceptionData - 0000000000000003  I:0 R:0 U:0 W:1 P:1 PK:0 SS:0 SGX:0\nRIP  - 0000000070B122A0, CS  - 0000000000000038, RFLAGS - 0000000000210046\nRAX  - 0000000070B2F000, RCX - 0000000000000000, RDX - 0000000070B79000\nRBX  - 0000000079C05A98, RSP - 000000007BF38EF8, RBP - 000000007B9EC018\nRSI  - 0000000000000000, RDI - 0000000070B2F000\nR8   - 0000000070B20BE0, R9  - 0000000077CC1195, R10 - 00000000791AF883\nR11  - 00000000791B96D0, R12 - 0000000079CB3000, R13 - 0000000000000000\nR14  - 0000000079A036E8, R15 - 0000000079A036F0\nDS   - 0000000000000030, ES  - 0000000000000030, FS  - 0000000000000030\nGS   - 0000000000000030, SS  - 0000000000000030\nCR0  - 0000000080010033, CR2 - 0000000070B2F000, CR3 - 000000007BC01000\nCR4  - 0000000000000668, CR8 - 0000000000000000\nDR0  - 0000000000000000, DR1 - 0000000000000000, DR2 - 0000000000000000\nDR3  - 0000000000000000, DR6 - 00000000FFFF0FF0, DR7 - 0000000000000400\nGDTR - 000000007B9DD000 0000000000000057, LDTR - 0000000000000000\nIDTR - 000000007B19A018 0000000000000FFF,   TR - 0000000000000048\nFXSAVE_STATE - 000000007B9DC460\n!!!! Find image based on IP(0x70B122A0) (No PDB)  (ImageBase=000000000106A398, EntryPoint=000000000106ABC3) !!!!\n```\n\nIn both cases, disabling NX protection with `lxc config set <inst> raw.qemu=\"-fw_cfg name=opt/org.tianocore/UninstallMemAttrProtocol,string=y\"` makes the guest bootable.\n\n",
